[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148219881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4148219881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4148219881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73QM_p","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-28T15:00:34Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T15:11:33Z","body":"Since you can’t actually set the animation duration here, I’m not sure if this is really useful. Since the start time is always \"0\", I’m skeptical about whether it’s necessary to set it to \"0.00\". Also, since there are no grid lines, I’m skeptical as well about whether displaying the end time in a timeline-like format is actually convenient.\r\n\r\nThe only point I can see that makes sense here is that we can see the animation’s duration at a glance.\r\n\r\nSo, if both the start and end times are to be displayed, I believe that feature should include the ability to edit the animation’s duration here (on import). You shouldn’t make the control panel narrower just to display uncontrollable information like \"0.00\". Insteads, you need to implement functionality that works with Slice.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"337\" height=\"595\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b727cbe-72bb-4d7d-808a-dac880c72457\" />\r\n\r\nIf not, this PR should simply display the end time in the Inspector or similar, making it a PR that just displays a single information about the animation’s duration somewhere.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148219881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148720496","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4148720496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4148720496,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73SHNw","user":{"login":"wwrzal","id":3277121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3277121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal","html_url":"https://github.com/wwrzal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-28T20:03:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T20:03:16Z","body":"@TokageItLab thanks for feedback!\r\n\r\nAllowing changing of duration sounds nice. However with how currently slices work, I'm not sure how to make those two options work together.\r\n\r\nWhat would you say about just showing length like in quick mock up below?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1804\" height=\"1309\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eedd9ca5-995e-450a-a853-5cffe0e906b2\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148720496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148728430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4148728430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4148728430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73SJJu","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin"