frames, so this makes no sense. Is there some easy solution to do the scaling?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148765064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148771937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4148771937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4148771937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73STxh","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-28T20:37:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T20:37:18Z","body":"We should not change the scaling on import. Also, please do not add a new feature that allows you to change only the length, as this would duplicate the functionality of Slice. Instead, you need to adapt the GUI to work with Slice. If that is hard for you, you should modify this PR to just display to a read-only length field.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4148771937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4149808995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4149808995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4149808995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73WQ9j","user":{"login":"wwrzal","id":3277121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3277121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal","html_url":"https://github.com/wwrzal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T09:47:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T09:47:33Z","body":"I have updated the branch with read only Animation Length property.\r\n@TokageItLab Please let me know if you see any issues in the implementation or UI.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4149808995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4149914686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4149914686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4149914686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73Wqw-","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T11:03:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T11:03:44Z","body":"I think displaying length information makes sense. For the code, please ask @godotengine/asset-pipeline to review it.\r\n\r\nIf I have one concern, it’s that the Trimming option changes the final duration of the animation, and I’m wondering at what stage we need to take the trimming results into account. I’d like to hear @godotengine/asset-pipeline 's opinion on this as well.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"745\" height=\"344\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f43ecf5c-f440-4723-bd07-7f988abbccd4\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4149914686/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188429448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4188429448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4188429448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75plyI","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-05T07:04:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-05T07:04:07Z","body":"I think it's okay. I would like to show frame count, since this information is useful for defining slices, which is the main reason to use the advanced import UI.\r\n\r\nAs for Trimming, the lengths and frame count shown should match the calculation used to split animation into slices.\r\n\r\nFinally, the duration property needs a `suffix:s` property hint so that the units show up.\r\n\r\nWishful thinking, but I wish I could see the whole animation editor here, including keyframes ;-) I understand that is extremely hard an