visually see the range of time for the slice or click to define start and end, but I think that is too much and I won't ask you to do that.\r\n\r\nSeeing the current frame number would be good enough. Timestamp in seconds is not as useful, because I cannot type the timestamp into the Start / End boxes for slices. I think duration in the inspector like your second screenshot is good enough for this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4188432777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4193329837","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117576#issuecomment-4193329837","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117576","id":4193329837,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc758SKt","user":{"login":"wwrzal","id":3277121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3277121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal","html_url":"https://github.com/wwrzal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwrzal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-06T15:58:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-06T15:58:49Z","body":"@lyuma such advanced gui 